sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Client
  participant A as actix handler<br/>(handle_put, PUT /{path})
  participant N as NIP-98 verify<br/>(auth::nip98::verify)
  participant W as WAC check<br/>(wac::evaluate_access_ctx_with_registry)
  participant S as Storage backend<br/>(trait Storage)

  C->>A: PUT /alice/notes/foo.ttl<br/>Authorization: Nostr <b64>
  A->>N: verify(header, url, method, None)
  alt auth fails
    N-->>A: Err — request proceeds as ANONYMOUS (agent = None)
    Note over A,W: anonymous agent + WAC deny →<br/>401 + WWW-Authenticate: Nostr, DPoP, Bearer
    A-->>C: 401 Unauthorized + WAC-Allow
  else auth ok
    N-->>A: pubkey → agent_uri = "did:nostr:<pubkey>"
    A->>W: enforce_write(path, mode=Write,<br/>ctx { web_id, payment_balance_sats })
    W->>S: get(<ancestor>.acl)  /* StorageAclResolver walk-up */
    S-->>W: AclDocument (inherited flag) | None
    alt denied
      W-->>A: false (deny-by-default)
      A-->>C: 403 Forbidden + WAC-Allow<br/>(401 if anonymous)
    else allowed
      W-->>A: true
      A->>S: put(path, bytes, content_type)
      S-->>A: ResourceMeta { etag, size, modified }
      A-->>C: 201 Created<br/>ETag, Link: rel="type"/"acl"/"describedby"<br/>(ldp::link_headers)
    end
  end

  Note over A,S: Server-managed triples (dc:modified, stat:size, stat:mtime)<br/>are materialised at GET render time (ldp::server_managed_triples),<br/>not persisted on PUT
  Note over A,S: Any storage IO error → PodError → 5xx<br/>Any RDF parse error → 400 Bad Request
